    "text": "<!doctype html><html><head><title>\n      Senior Backend Developer (TypeScript/Node.js) - Utorg\n    </title><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org/\",\"@type\":\"JobPosting\",\"title\":\"Senior Backend Developer (TypeScript/Node.js)\",\"description\":\"&lt;h5&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-c4122e4f-7fff-fe12-4b08-ed91839827fc&quot;&gt;About Utorg&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Founded in 2019, Utorg builds the infrastructure for stablecoin payments: on- and off-ramps, self-custodial wallets, and crypto cards. Over 2 million users across 130+ countries already buy, hold, and spend crypto through our app. On the B2B side, the same rails power 2,100+ platforms, with $2.4B+ moved to date.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fully MiCA-authorized across the EEA. PCI DSS Level 2 certified. Backed by Dragonfly, TA Ventures, and Hypra.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-f1f1663d-7fff-5ebf-bd2e-24688e6b1f9d&quot;&gt;Location: Remote&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-f1f1663d-7fff-5ebf-bd2e-24688e6b1f9d&quot;&gt;Tech stack: TypeScript, Node.js, NestJS, PostgreSQL, TypeORM, NATS JetStream, Redis, Jest, Docker, Kubernetes, Google Cloud Platform.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-f1f1663d-7fff-5ebf-bd2e-24688e6b1f9d&quot;&gt;Blockchains: EVM-compatible, Bitcoin-family, Tron, Solana, TON.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h5&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-f1f1663d-7fff-5ebf-bd2e-24688e6b1f9d&quot;&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Backend Engineer who thinks in systems and owns the outcome: &lt;/strong&gt;two large-scale microservice platforms (30+ and 25+ services), blockchain integrations handling real user funds across multiple networks, a fintech product available in 190+ countries.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This role partially offloads the Tech Lead. That means making architectural calls independently, driving complex integrations with paymen\",\"identifier\":{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Utorg\",\"value\":\"8220725\"},\"datePosted\":\"2026-08-14T11:19:59+03:00\",\"employmentType\":\"FULL_TIME\",\"hiringOrganization\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Utorg\",\"sameAs\":\"https://utorg.teamtailor.com\"},\"jobLocationType\":\"TELECOMMUTE\",\"jobLocation\":[{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"address\":{}}]}</script></head><body><h1 class=\"font-company-header hyphens-auto text-4xl @md:text-6xl @lg:text-7xl leading-tight\">Senior Backend Developer (TypeScript/Node.js)</h1><p>Trimmed fixture: the page body is left out.</p></body></html>"
